ause v2.3.0 is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. (2) Rolled back checkout-api to v2.2.9 in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002. v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy in production. Follow-up: confirm v2.2.9 is the desired long-term target given the CVE quarantine on v2.3.0, and determine a fix for v2.3.1 before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2026-05"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 21610, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015ZHEvJ7UgeBo4UnW2EgsWs", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2026-05", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 21610, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015ZHEvJ7UgeBo4UnW2EgsWs", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 23620, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.2.9 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy production release, but the rollback was rejected because it is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. I used v2.2.9, the next most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- **Current state:** checkout-api is healthy on v2.2.9 with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18 on v2.3.1.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback attempt and the CVE rejection, the final rollback, and follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups for the team:\n- Confirm v2.2.9 is the right long-term version, since v2.3.0 is quarantined and v2.3.1 is unhealthy.\n- Find the v2.3.1 failure before redeploying it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thin